OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mainly dry
OL,6,Fnight although becoming rather cloudy,
OL,7,Fthe odd light shower in the east
OL,8,Flater. Clear periods across the south
OL,9,Fand west will lead to a slight frost.
OL,10,FLight and variable winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FMainly dry and rather cloudy,
OL,13,Fbest of any brightness across western
OL,14,FTayside. Chance of a light shower,
OL,15,Fmainly in the east.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FMainly
OL,18,Fdry and cloudy, although a few light
OL,19,Fshowers possible in the east. Clearer
OL,20,Fskies across the west at times with a
OL,21,Fchance of overnight frost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
